Scoring Logic → Baseline Fluency Score

Question Weights (MVP)

Section                              Weight

Knowledge & mental models (Q1–Q3)    30 points
Prompting skills (Q4–Q5)             20 points
Applied judgment (Q6–Q7)             20 points
Safety awareness (Q8)                10 points
Confidence (Q9)                      10 points
Usage frequency (Q10)                10 points
Total                                100 points


Scoring Rules
● Correct MCQ/scenario = full points for that question
● Incorrect = 0 for that question (no penalty)

● Confidence (Q9):
○ 1 → 2 pts
○ 2 → 4 pts
○ 3 → 6 pts
○ 4 → 8 pts
○ 5 → 10 pts

● Usage frequency (Q10):
○ Never → 0
○ Monthly → 2
○ Weekly → 5
○ Multiple weekly → 8
○ Daily → 10

Final sum = Baseline AI Fluency Score (0–100)

